            "Title": "VT Reedle Shot 300 Facial Boosting First Ampoule 2ml x 6",
            "Body (HTML)": "<p>Discover the VT Reedle Shot 300 Facial Boosting First Ampoule, designed for smooth skin texture care. This set includes six convenient 2ml ampoules to help prep your skin.</p><p>Apply this boosting first ampoule as the initial step in your daily skincare routine for a refreshed and revitalized complexion.</p><p><strong>Identity:</strong> VT Reedle Shot 300 Facial Boosting First Ampoule 2ml x 6</p><p><strong>Directions:</strong> During your evening skincare routine, take an appropriate amount onto clean, bare skin after cleansing and spread it by pressing gently with your fingertips. After Reedle Shot 300 is absorbed, finish with a moisturizing skincare product or a skincare product containing the active ingredients you want to enhance.</p><p><strong>Warnings:</strong> Stop use and consult a dermatologist if redness, swelling, itching or other irritation occurs during or after use, including after sun exposure. Do not apply to wounds or broken skin. Avoid contact with eyes and lips. Do not use with beauty devices or after laser or other skin procedures. A tingling sensation may occur and varies by individual. If you have allergic or sensitive skin, patch test on a small area before use. Use sunscreen when exposed to sunlight after use. Keep out of reach of children. Store away from direct sunlight.</p><p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Water, Dipropylene Glycol, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Silica, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polyisobutene, Glycereth-26, Ethylhexylglycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Adenosine, Sodium Polyacrylate, Centella Asiatica Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Sorbitan Oleate, Xanthan Gum, Propolis Extract, Asiaticoside, Madecassoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Glycine, Serine, Glutamic Acid, Aspartic Acid, Leucine, Alanine, Lysine, Arginine, Tyrosine, Phenylalanine, Threonine, Proline, Val